{title: 555 - Shepherd of Tender Youth}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Christian Life}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[F/C]Shepherd of [C7/Bb]tender [Gm/D]you,
[C7]Guiding [F/C]in [C]love [F]and truth,
[C/G]Through devious way;
[C]Christ [Am]our triumphant [F/C]King,
[C7]We come Thy [F/C]name [C7/Bb]to [Am]sin,
[Am/C]Hither [F]our [Gm]children [Bb]bring
[Dm/A]To [F/C]shout [C7/Bb]Thy [Dm/A]praise.

Verse 2:
[F/C]Thou are our [C7/Bb]holy [Gm/D]Lord,
[C7]Thee all [C]subduing [F/C]Word,
[C/G]Healer of strife;
[C]Thou [Am]didst Thyself [F/C]abase,
[C7]That from sin's [F/C]deep [C7/Bb]disgrace
[Am/C]Thou [F]mightest [Gm]save [Am]our [Bb]race,
[Dm/A]And [F/C]give [C7/Bb]us [Dm/A]life.

Verse 3:
[F/C]Thou are the [C7/Bb]great [F/C]High [Gm/D]Priest;
[C7]Thou has [F/C]prepared the feast
[C/G]Of heavenly love;
[C]While [Am]in our [Gm/D]mortal [Bb]pain
[C7]None call on [F/C]Thee [C7/Bb]in [Am]vain;
[Am/C]Help [F]Thou does [Gm]not [Am]disdain,
[Dm/A]Help [F/C]from [C7/Bb]above.

Verse 4:
[F/C]Ever be [C7/Bb]Thou [F/C]our [Gm/D]Guide,
[C7]Our Shepherd [C]and [F]our pride,
[C/G]Our staff and song;
[C]Jesus, [Am]Thou [Gm/D]Christ [F/C]of [Bb]God,
[C7]By Thy perennial [Am]word,
[Am/C]Lead [F]us where [Gm]Thou [Am]hast [Bb]trod,
[Dm/A]Make [F/C]our [C7/Bb]faith [Dm/A]strong.
